               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_0ef8a8a1">35 x 26</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_ebcc4276">Written in brown and purple ink. Paper: 14 staves. With instructions for the printer. Verso of title page blank. Paginated from first music page as 8-17, being a part of a gathering of different manuscripts published as "Sange og Viser", opus 77. Above the first stave: "N 4 IV Bruden / Ballade <rend xml:id="idm33" rend="line-through">21</rend> el. 22. At the bottom of p. 8 Hartmann has written: "NB Denne Sang kan heelt igjennem udføres af en enkelt Baryton eller dybere Sopran, uden Chor." At the end of the music on p. 17 end-dated: "13/4 80."</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
